Z||000000||DaRkLoRD||12-31-1999||08:28 PM||||a little under 5 hours left here until the 21st century. Anyone know when those Hover Conversions will be available for Fieros?<P>For anyone who'll be near a computer tonight, take a look at  <A HREF="http://www.duh-2000.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.duh-2000.com/</A> , a monthly contest about the stupidest things said about Y2K. Very funny site!<P>From the looks of the news, it looks like Y2K might not be  <A HREF="http://208.56.50.86/endworld.mp3" TARGET=_blank>http://208.56.50.86/endworld.mp3</A>  The End Of The World As We Know It (tm).. oh well. Still a few more countries to roll over yet.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Anyway, it's been a pretty decent millennium (at least the 19 years of it that I've experienced..) and I'm hoping the next one will be even better. (the millennium, not just the next 19 years) This will probably won't be be my last forum post this week, but probably will be for today. Last post of the month, and this year for that matter. Last post of the decade too. Can't forget the last post of the century either. And I think it just might be my last post of the millennium too.. wow.<P>Looking forward to lots more Fiero discussions in the 21st century..<P>Happy new years everyone.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||12
Z||000001||Cooter||12-31-1999||09:49 PM||||Kinda funny I think because the last time I checked the new century doesnt start until 2001. I had a nice little argument at the furniture store over their "No payment until the next century" sale. Finally the manager told me to get my cheap a** out of the store! All I wanted was a new house full of furniture and not make a payment until Jan. 1 2001. I mentioned false advertisement and that I have an attorney in the family and he suddenly got nice again, but still no new Lazy Boy for the bowl games. Oh, well.||||reg||1
