Z||000006||Cooter||01-02-2000||02:29 AM||||Advanced Micro Devices- they build the "k" series of CPU's. Like the k6, and the new k7 or athlon processor. They are the reason why PC prices have come done to affordable levels. Without their competition, Intel would have a Microsoft like monopoly on the CPU market.<P>BTW- If you are not sure about buying an AMD powered computer, many years ago when Intel could not keep up the supply of their chips, AMD built Intel processors for them. I had a couple of Intel 386's that also had the AMD logo on the chip!||||reg||1
