Z||000009||Raydar||01-02-2000||05:31 PM||||Well, Happy (belated) New Year to you all! I'm glad that the Y2K glitch turned out to be a big "non-issue" (at least from my point of view). It was really funny. The press had camped out in our building for HOURS. They looked really depressed when they didn't have any doom-and-gloom stories to report. NADA. Zip. What a bunch of Vultures.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
